ight: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260805/202608050427368040_720.jpg" alt="" src="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260805/202608050427368040_720.jpg"> </div><p><strong>【转会新闻】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-05/6a724e21be7d4native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">HWG！罗马诺：34岁萨拉赫加盟特拉布宗体育，双方将签约两年</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260805/202608050440071559_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260805/202608050440071559_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260805/202608050440071559_720.jpg"> </div><p>罗马诺消息，萨拉赫将加盟特拉布宗体育，here we go！</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-04/6a71fdd992a18native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">DO：阿森纳签吉马良斯即将达全面协议，球员正等待体检和手续完成</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260804/202608042301144861.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260804/202608042301144861_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260804/202608042301144861_720.jpg"> </div><p>据TA名记奥恩斯坦消息，阿森纳与纽卡斯尔联即将就中场球员布鲁诺·吉马良斯的转会达成全面协议。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-04/6a72047b82659native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">记者：预计吉马良斯24小时内离开纽卡训练营，交易价值8000万镑</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-05/6a721425265e3native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">德天空：皇马有望本周签下迪奥曼德，今天谈判后非常接近达协议</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260805/202608050033002869.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260805/202608050033002869.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260805/202608050033002869.jpg"> </div><p>德天空记者Florian Plettenberg消息，皇马有望本周完成迪奥曼德的转会。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-05/6a722604899d8native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">再次确认！罗马诺：迪奥曼德加盟皇马已无悬念，只待莱比锡放行</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-04/6a71fd1431d46native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">ESPN：红军希望将巴尔科拉转会费谈至1.15亿欧左右，球员渴望加盟</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.9" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260804/202608042259428440.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.9" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.9" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260804/202608042259428440.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260804/202608042259428440.jpg"> </div><p>据ESPN资深利物浦记者Beth Lindop报道，红军希望将巴尔科拉的转会费谈到1.15亿欧左右。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-04/6a72033032b7fnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">邮报：赖因德斯成为森林5500万镑引援目标，球员对转会持开放态度</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251221/6946e071f0877.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251221/6946e071f0877.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251221/6946e071f0877.jpg"> </div><p>邮报独家消息，赖因德斯是诺丁汉森林的一个价值5500万镑的引援目标。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-05/6a720ff3e762dnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">打破队史引援纪录！巴萨女足官宣签下26岁巴西前锋凯罗琳</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.61" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260805/202608050015083570.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.61" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.61" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260805/202608050015083570.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260805/202608050015083570.jpg"> </div><p>巴萨女足官方宣布，从曼城女足签下26岁巴西女足国脚凯罗琳，合同直到2030年。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-05/6a72111fe9ffcnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">西记者：若阿森纳报价1.5亿欧元，皇马愿给维尼修斯奖金促成转会</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250317/67d7fcd294250.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250317/67d7fcd294250.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250317/67d7fcd294250.jpg"> </div><p>记者皮孔透露，如果有俱乐部愿意支付转会费，皇马可以拿出一部分转会费分给维尼修斯本人，以此推动交易完成。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-05/6a7212323a12dnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">罗马诺：曼城接触佩德罗·内托，若萨维尼奥离队他将是引援候选</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260805/202608050024581340.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260805/202608050024581340_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260805/202608050024581340_720.jpg"> </div><p>记者罗马诺独家消息，曼城已经开始与切尔西前锋佩德罗·内托的团队开始直接接触，讨论转会的可能性。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-05/6a722aedd8b61native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">HWG！罗马诺：科莫签扬·库托与多特达口头协议，租借费200万欧</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260805/202608050210155535_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260805/202608050210155535_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260805/202608050210155535_720.jpg"> </div><p>罗马诺消息，科莫签下扬·库托达协议，here we go!</p><p><strong>【其它新闻】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-05/6a7242c6697e0native.htm#pl_box" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">黄牌新规！官方：新赛季欧战联赛阶段开始改为球员累计4黄停赛</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.51" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_191115/5dceb92a0fe9f.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.51" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.51" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_191115/5dceb92a0fe9f.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_191115/5dceb92a0fe9f.jpg"> </div><p>欧足联修改新赛季欧战规则，联赛阶段开始将从此前的累计3黄停赛，改为累计4张黄牌停赛。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-05/6a7244297c08enative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">再见队长！数千球迷到场送别巴雷西，众名宿抬棺，马尔蒂尼落泪</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260805/6a724b5b7911f.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260805/6a724b5b7911f.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260805/6a724b5b7911f.jpg"> </div><p>米兰传奇球星巴雷西的葬礼，在当地时间8月4日在米兰圣安布罗焦教堂举行。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-04/6a720553e6dafnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">约旦足协主席爆料：美国通过世界杯向我们征税，FIFA行径如同勒索</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260719/6a5c25dd57f5a_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260719/6a5c25dd57f5a.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260719/6a5c25dd57f5a.jpg"> </div><p>据约旦足协主席阿里·本·阿尔·侯赛因王子在社媒发文爆料，国际足联存在诸多问题。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-04/6a71f6049e921native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">号角报：如果因凡蒂诺离任，阿足协主席塔皮亚在FIFA地位也会削弱</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260726/6a65d829655fc_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260726/6a65d829655fc.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260726/6a65d829655fc.jpg"> </div><p>国际足联主席因凡蒂诺因为世界杯股份出售一事，正遭受信任危机。《号角报》分析了相关话题。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-04/6a71f12a8d745native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">昔日周薪25万！阿邦拉霍：如今给桑乔5万都嫌多 他28岁退役也正常</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250815/689f42aa0d3d3.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250815/689f42aa0d3d3.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250815/689f42aa0d3d3.jpg"> </div><p>桑乔与曼联合同到期之后一直没有下家，阿邦拉霍很担心这位边锋目前的处境，他声称哪怕桑乔两年后退役也不会惊讶。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-04/6a7202bdd682enative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">全市场：迈尼昂作为米兰队长却缺席巴雷西葬礼，引发球迷批评</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250604/68400bf8e01da.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250604/68400bf8e01da.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250604/68400bf8e01da.jpg"> </div><p>据全市场网报道称，迈尼昂作为队长却缺席巴雷西葬礼，引发球迷批评。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-05/6a72528784c32native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">世一腰的盯人！女友讲述与罗德里相识：他死缠烂打追了我两个月</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.78" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260805/202608050503592939.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.78" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.78" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260805/202608050503592939.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260805/202608050503592939.jpg"> </div><p>在西班牙国家电视台RTVE为世界杯制作的纪录片当中，罗德里的女友劳拉・伊格莱西亚斯讲述了二人相识的故事。</p><script> 	$(function(){ 	    $(".video-bg").find('span').click(function(){/*视频播放*/             var _this = this;             var index = $(".video-bg span").index(this);             var MediaArr = document.getElementsByTagName("video");             $(this).parent().hide();             MediaArr[index].play();             MediaArr[index].controls = true;             $(".video-box").each(function(i, item) {                 if ($(this).find('span').get(0) !== _this) {                     $(this).find('.video-bg').show();                     MediaArr[i].pause();                     MediaArr[i].controls = false;                 }             })         });  	if(typeof(canLoadImage)=='function'){/*新版图片打开方式定义*/ 		if(!((typeof(getNetType)==='function' && getNetType()) || canLoadImage())){             $(".img_wrap").css('background-color', '#D9D9DA').find('.play_btn').css('text-indent','0');         } 		var platform = $('input[name="platform"]').val(); 		platform = platform=='ios'?'ios':'android'; 		var img_op = img_op_value = ''; 		function show_small_gif1(){ 			$(".img_wrap").each(function(i){ 				img_op = get_img_op_attr($(this),platform); 				img_op_value = get_op(img_op,platform); 				var lineHeight = $(this).find('.play_btn').height();  				if((img_op_value==1||img_op_value==2||img_op_value==3||img_op_value==4||img_op_value==7)&&$(this).attr("data-thumb")!=''){ 				    $(this).css('background-image',"url('"+$(this).attr("data-thumb")+"')"); 				    $(this).find('.play_btn').html('').css('font-size','3em').css('color','white').css('line-height', lineHeight + 'px').css('background', 'url(https://static4style.duoduocdn.com/common/img/ic_gif_big@3x.png) no-repeat center center').css('background-size','104px'); 				} 			}); 		}  		setTimeout(show_small_gif1(),100); 		/*load_type 1=wifi,2=4G&&loadimg,3=4G&&noloadimg*/ 		function load_img(this_obj,load_type,status) { 			img_op = get_img_op_attr(this_obj,platform); 			img_op_value = get_op(img_op,platform); 			/*var img = this_obj.children('img:first');*/ 			var img = this_obj.find('img:eq(0)'); 			if(load_type==1){ 				if(img_op_value==1 || img_op_value==7){ 					if(img.attr('t-rc')==img.attr('src')){ 						open_img(img_op_value,platform,img.attr('t-rc')); 					}else{ 						this_obj.find('.play_btn').hide(); 						img.attr('src', img.attr('t-rc')); 					} 				}else if(status==1){ 					open_img(img_op_value,platform,img.attr('t-rc')); 				} 			}else if(load_type==2&&this_obj.attr('type')=='IMG'){ 				this_obj.find('.play_btn').hide(); 				img.attr('src', img.attr('t-rc')); 			} 			if(typeof(getJSType)=='function' && getJSType()){                 img.load(function(){                     window.webkit.messageHandlers.imageLoaded.postMessage('test');                 }); 			}else if(platform=='ios'&&typeof(imageLoaded)=='function'){ 				img.load(function(){ 				    /*加载完成*/                     imageLoaded(); 				}); 			} 		}; 		 		var ms = 1000; 		if(platform === 'android'){ 		    ms = 10; 		} 		setTimeout(function(){ 			if(typeof(getNetType)=='function' && getNetType()){/*wifi*/ 			$(".img_wrap").each(function(i){ 				load_img($(this),1,0) 				}); 			}else{ 				if(canLoadImage()){/*载入图片*/ 					$(".img_wrap").each(function(i){ 						load_img($(this),2,0) 					}); 			}else{ 				$(".img_wrap").each(function(i){ 					load_img($(this),3,0); 				}); 			} 			} 		}, ms);  		$(".img_wrap").click( 				function(){ 				    var jumpUrl = $(this).attr('jump-url');                     if(jumpUrl){                         return openLink(jumpUrl);                     } 					load_img($(this),1,1); 					event.stopPropagation(); 				} 			); 		$('a').click(function(e){ 			img_op = get_img_op_attr($(this),platform); 			img_op_value = parseInt(get_op(img_op,platform)); 			if(img_op_value>=0&&img_op_value<=7){ 				open_img(img_op_value,platform,$(this).attr('href')); 				if ( e && e.preventDefault ) 					e.preventDefault(); 				else 					window.event.returnValue = false;  				return false; 			}     	}); 	}else{/*旧版本*/ 		function show_small_gif(){ 			$(".img_wrap").each(function(i){ 				/*console.log($(this).css('background-image'));*/ 				$(this).find('.play_btn').css("text-indent","0"); 				if($(this).attr("data-ratio") && /gif/i.test($(this).attr("type")) ){                     var ratio = $(this).attr("data-ratio");                     $(this).css({width:"100%",height:0,"padding-top":100/ratio+"%"}).find(".play_btn").css({top:0,height:'100%'});                 } 				if($(this).attr("data-thumb")!=''){                     $(this).append('<img class="img-thumb" style="position: absolute;top: 0;left: 0;width: 100%;height: 100%;object-fit: cover;" src="'+ $(this).attr("data-thumb") +'" />'); 					$(this).find('.play_btn').html('').css('font-size','3em').css('color','white').css('background', 'url(https://static4style.duoduocdn.com/common/img/ic_gif_big@3x.png) no-repeat center center').css('background-size','104px'); 				} 			}); 		}; 		show_small_gif(); 		$(".img_wrap").click(function (event) { 		    var jumpUrl = $(this).attr('jump-url'); 			if(jumpUrl){ 				return openLink(jumpUrl); 			} 			if ($(this).attr('type') == 'IMG') {                 $(this).css("width", 'auto');                 $(this).css("height", 'auto');                 $(this).css("background", 'none');                 $(this).removeClass("img_wrap");                 $(this).find('.play_btn').hide();                 var img = $(this).find('img:eq(0)');                 img.attr('src', img.attr('t-rc'));                 img.attr('data-src', img.attr('t-rc'));                 event.stopPropagation();             }else{                 $(this).find('.play_btn').hide();                 var img = $(this).find('img:eq(0)');                 img.attr('src', img.attr('t-rc')).on("load",function(){                     $(this).css({width:"auto",height:"auto","padding-top":0,background:"none"});                     $(this).find('.img-thumb').remove();                 }.bind(this));                 img.attr('data-src', img.attr('t-rc'));             } 		});  	    if(typeof(getNetType)=='function' && getNetType()){             /*$(".img_wrap").click();*/             setTimeout('$(".img_wrap").click()',200); 		}else{/*旧版非gif图片3G直接载入图片*/             $(".img_wrap").each(function(i){                 if($(this).attr('type')=='IMG'){                     var img = $(this).find('img:eq(0)');                     var ratio = $(this).attr("data-ratio");                     if(ratio){                         $(this).css({                             width:'100%',                             height:0,                            'padding-top':100/ratio+'%'                         }).find(".play_btn").css({                             top:0,                             height:'100%'                         });                         img.attr('src', img.attr('t-rc')).on("load",function(){                           $(this).css({'padding-top':'0'}).find(".play_btn").hide();                         }.bind(this));                     }else{                       $(this).css("width", 'auto');                       $(this).css("height", 'auto');                       $(this).css("background", 'none');                       $(this).removeClass("img_wrap");                       $(this).find('.play_btn').hide();                       img.attr('src', img.attr('t-rc'));                    }                 }             }); 		} 	}  	function get_op(img_op,platform){ 		img_op_arr = img_op.split('|'); 		if(img_op_arr.length!=4)return 5; 		switch (platform){             case 'android' :                 value = img_op_arr[0].split('_');                 break;             case 'ios' :                 value = img_op_arr[1].split('_');                 break;             case 'wap' :                 value = img_op_arr[2].split('_');                 break;             case 'pc' :                 value = img_op_arr[3].split('_');                 break;             default :                 value = [5,''];         }         return value[0]; 	}  	function get_img_op_attr(img_ele,platform){ 		if(platform=='android'){ 			if(window.zhibo8OpenImage && window.zhibo8OpenImage.openInnerExplorerBrowser){ 				op_value = img_ele.attr('img_op_new'); 			}else{ 				op_value = img_ele.attr('img_op'); 			} 		}else if(typeof(getJSType)=='function' && getJSType()){ 			if(window.webkit && window.webkit.messageHandlers && window.webkit.messageHandlers.openInnerExplorerBrowser){ 				op_value = img_ele.attr('img_op_new'); 			}else{ 				op_value = img_ele.attr('img_op'); 			} 		}else{ 			op_value = img_ele.attr('img_op'); 		} 		return op_value; 	} 	 	function openLink(aHref) {         if(!aHref) return;         var aNode = document.createElement('a');         aNode.href = aHref;         aNode.click();     }  	function open_img(img_op_value,platform,src){ /*		if(!(img_op_value==1||img_op_value==2||img_op_value==3||img_op_value==4)){ 			return false; 		}*/ 		/*if(src=''||src==undefine)return;*/ 		if(img_op_value==1){ 			if(platform=='android'){ 				window.zhibo8OpenImage.openNativeImageBrowser(src); 			}else if(typeof(getJSType)=='function' && getJSType()){ 				window.webkit.messageHandlers.openNativeImageBrowser.postMessage(src); 			}else{ 				openNativeImageBrowser(src); 			} 		}else if(img_op_value==2){ 			if(platform=='android'){ 				window.zhibo8OpenImage.openImageLinkWebBrowser(src); 			}else if(typeof(getJSType)=='function' && getJSType()){ 				window.webkit.messageHandlers.openImageLinkWebBrowser.postMessage(src); 			}else{ 				openImageLinkWebBrowser(src); 			} 		}else if(img_op_value==3){ 			if(platform=='android'){ 				window.zhibo8OpenImage.openWebViewImageBrowser(src); 			}else if(typeof(getJSType)=='function' && getJSType()){ 				window.webkit.messageHandlers.openWebViewImageBrowser.postMessage(src); 			}else{ 				openWebViewImageBrowser(src); 			} 		}else if(img_op_value==4){ 			if(platform=='android'){ 				window.zhibo8OpenImage.openSystemWebViewBrowser(src); 			}else if(typeof(getJSType)=='function' && getJSType()){ 				window.webkit.messageHandlers.openSystemWebViewBrowser.postMessage(src); 			}else{ 				openSystemWebViewBrowser(src); 			} 		}else if(img_op_value==7){ 			if(platform=='android'){ 				window.zhibo8OpenImage.openInnerExplorerBrowser(src); 			}else if(typeof(getJSType)=='function' && getJSType()){ 				window.webkit.messageHandlers.openInnerExplorerBrowser.postMessage(src); 			}else{ 				openSystemWebViewBrowser(src); 			} 		} 	} 	}) </script><style>.video-box{position:relative;}.video-bg{position: absolute;z-index: 8 !important;width: 100%;height: 100%;background-color: transparent;}.video-bg span{position: absolute;left: 50%;top:50%;margin-left: -2.94em;margin-top:  -2.94em;width: 5.88em;height: 5.88em;background: url(https://static4style.duoduocdn.com/m_images/inside/outs/ic_play@2x.png) center/46px no-repeat;}.video-bg span{position: absolute;width: 100px;height: 100px;left: 50%;top:50%;margin-left: -50px;margin-top:  -50px;}</style>
